@format 1
@id functionality.media-loading.common.direct-source
@title Media loading — common Source requests
@section Functionality
@area Media loading — Common
@entry source-browse, source-enter
@summary Trace Source-bar Browse and Return requests that bypass Files and call the shared viewer pipeline directly.
@related functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag source

@alias source = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PSource

[source-browse] Source Browse button <input>
- Open the Source picker, reject disallowed audio-only media, and request the selected viewer source when accepted @ source.PSourceOpenHandle(...)
> source-browse-result

[source-enter] Source path Return key <input>
- Require Return, an existing typed path, and audio-only policy acceptance before requesting the viewer source @ source.PSourceKeyHandle(...)
> source-enter-result

[source-browse-result] Browse outcome <decision>
- A viewer request exists only after picker acceptance and source-policy acceptance @ source.PSourceOpenHandle(...)
? "Viewer request issued" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Cancelled or rejected" > source-browse-stop

[source-enter-result] Typed-source outcome <decision>
- Continue only when the typed path passed Source validation @ source.PSourceKeyHandle(...)
? "Viewer request issued" > map:functionality.media-loading.common.viewer
? "Path rejected" > source-enter-stop

[source-browse-stop] Browse ends without request <output>
= No shared viewer load begins.

[source-enter-stop] Typed source rejected <output>
= No shared viewer load begins.
